  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "f62f1f90-ea1a-4def-9bfd-c424f5a1220a"],
 " by walking its stored Chain, and stores them under Value.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"638583c7-68c5-4419-a126-69ff6aee003a"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["Compute"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/Compute", 
     "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["sol", "TI"], "[", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["object", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["key", "TI"]}], "]"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c312d66c-522c-44b2-a207-20d941b5e028"],
 "\[LineSeparator]does this for every automatic tensor of the entry.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"110649f3-1667-4e41-8df0-89ec89ce4395"],
 "A Chain entry ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
