  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "0ef9b930-3702-4585-8d04-4495a2b46ff1"],
 "} raises or lowers indices with the metric. Nothing is computed if the \
Chain is unset.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"7e745cc0-0459-45c7-a096-ab1fd7772110"],
 "Options are Chain, which overrides and stores the recipe, Using, which \
